From 323e51dbd222356dc3a55102c57f60170ee19f82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ananwanan <coder-cc@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 23:45:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Support Mbed TLS 4 PSA cryptography and preserve ZIP abort
 cleanup

Use the public TF-PSA-Crypto API for AES, PBKDF2, HMAC and message digests while preserving Mbed TLS 2/3 support. Serialize shared PSA calls for kits without threading enabled, retain authentication failures, and keep crypto contexts local to each operation.

Includes the upstream fork ZIP compressor abort regression fix from 0a6ff818eefd3f13a941ccf6994bcf72cdc122bb. No source parser logic is moved into the application.
